  unitName: "Lasswell (7\u2605, Original)"
  unitId: 20916
  unitNumber: 1502
  description: A young knight hailing from the Kingdom of Grandshelt in another world.
    When Lasswell lost his parents at a young age, he was taken in by Rain's family.
    For this reason he feels an unwavering respect towards Rain's father, and his
    precious blade "Shiden" is said to reflect this connection between them. Growing
    up alongside Rain, he is one of the few to rival his friend in natural talent.
    However, he does not feel he is Rain's equal, and harbors conflicting feelings
    of trust and inadequacy toward his friend.
  summonDesc: You have need of my blade?<br>I will not disappoint you, I promise.
  fusionDesc: This power...<br>Perhaps I have at last drawn closer to my ideal.
  evoDesc: In gaining control over myself...<br>My blade swings true.
  element: 2
  rarity: 6
